# Line endings.
#
# The repository stores LF, and every checkout keeps LF regardless of platform.
#
# Without `eol=lf` a Windows checkout produces CRLF, and prettier — whose
# endOfLine default is "lf" — then reports every frontend file as badly
# formatted. That failure would appear locally while CI, running on Linux, stayed
# green: the worst kind, because the two disagree about the same commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be touched by normalisation.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Photography formats, for the fixtures and anything the pipeline produces.
*.dng  binary
*.tif  binary
*.tiff binary
